unes as they enjoy the rhythmic challenge of matching tiles to the music. Players can pick their favorite song from a wide range of musical genres, including pop, rock, electronic, hip-hop, and more.\n\nThe game revolves around tiles, and players have to match the tiles to the beat of the song. The tiles come in different colors, shapes, and sizes, making each level unique and challenging. Players have to match the tiles to the beat, making the game a test of their rhythm and timing skills. As they progress through the game, the levels become more hectic, making it a thrilling experience.\n\nBeat Tiles also features a track and song library, where players can create their own playlist and choose their favorite songs to play. They can also change things about the game, like the sound effects, the way the tiles look, and more, to make it a truly personal experience.\n\nAs long as you love music, this game is for you. Music unites us all, no matter how old we are or where we come from.\n\nPrivacy policy: https://cadenverse.io/privacy-policy/\n\nTerms Of Use: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1KPoNPp2UPB-IOiVv1rI1enbika_9uD5RId9Nr7aYJJw/edit#", "averageUserRating": 3, "minimumOsVersion": "15.0", "trackCensoredName": "Beat Tiles: Music Game", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/beat-tiles-music-game/id6445803857?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "bundleId": "com.cadenverse.beat.tiles.musicgame", "sellerUrl": "https://cadenverse.com", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 3, "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "281576448", "formattedPrice": "무료", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 2, "trackContentRating": "4+", "userRatingCount": 2}]}